### Mini réseau social — requêtes de test (via gateway :8081)
@base = http://localhost:8081/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/users/health
###
GET {{base}}/posts/health
###
GET {{base}}/notifications/health

### 1. Inscription utilisateur A
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pseudo": "alice", "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "password" }

### 2. Inscription utilisateur B
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pseudo": "bob", "email": "bob@example.com", "password": "password" }

### 3. Connexion A -> capture le token
# @name loginA
POST {{base}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "password" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 4. Profil public de A
# Segment doublé : le gateway retire /api/users/, la route du service est /users/{id}
GET {{base}}/users/users/1

### 5. A modifie sa bio
PATCH {{base}}/users/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bio": "Bonjour, ceci est Alice." }

### 6. A crée un post
POST {{base}}/posts/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Mon premier post", "content": "Contenu de démonstration." }

### 7. Fil d'actualité (public, paginé)
GET {{base}}/posts/posts?page=0&limit=20

### 8. Détail d'un post + commentaires
GET {{base}}/posts/posts/1

### 9. Connexion B -> token de B
# @name loginB
POST {{base}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bob@example.com", "password": "password" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenB", response.body.token); %}

### 10. B commente le post de A  (déclenche l'événement Redis comment.created)
POST {{base}}/posts/posts/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Super post !" }

### 11. A consulte ses notifications (la notif du commentaire de B doit apparaître)
GET {{base}}/notifications/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. A marque la notification 1 comme lue
PATCH {{base}}/notifications/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. A supprime son post
DELETE {{base}}/posts/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Observabilité — métriques Prometheus
GET {{base}}/users/metrics
###
GET {{base}}/posts/metrics
###
GET {{base}}/notifications/metrics
